champ=banner('THE WORLD<br>ON THE <em>GRID.</em>','An all-electric racing championship imagined entirely across the landscapes of Morocco.','THE CHAMPIONSHIP / SEASON 2032',2,'../','hero-trophy')+f'''<section class="section"><div class="page-container"><div class="split-editorial"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / A NEW RACING WORLD</span><h2 class="display-xl">BUILT FROM<br>PURE <span class="text-lime">MOMENTUM.</span></h2></div><div><p class="lead">One purpose-built electric chassis. Sixteen of the world's most determined competitors. Eight races across an extraordinary country.</p><p>IONRUSH is a fictional sports universe designed to explore what the next generation of motorsport could feel like. Every team, driver, circuit, result and event belongs to this original imagined championship.</p></div></div><div class="stat-grid"><div><strong>08</strong><span>TEAMS</span></div><div><strong>16</strong><span>DRIVERS</span></div><div><strong>08</strong><span>ROUNDS</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>CHAMPION</span></div></div></div></section><section class="section section-cream"><div class="page-container">{section_heading('02 / HOW IT WORKS','THE RULES<br>OF THE RUSH.','A focused sporting format built around precision and energy.')}<div class="rules-grid"><article><span class="mono">01 / THE GRID</span><h3>ONE CHASSIS.</h3><p>All eight teams compete with the IR-32 platform. Setup, strategy and driving make the difference.</p></article><article><span class="mono">02 / THE WEEKEND</span><h3>QUALIFY. RACE. REPEAT.</h3><p>Each fictional round features practice, a timed qualifying session, and a main race.</p></article><article><span class="mono">03 / THE POINTS</span><h3>EVERY PLACE COUNTS.</h3><p>The top ten finishers score 25, 18, 15, 12, 10, 8, 6, 4, 2 and 1 points.</p></article><article><span class="mono">04 / THE TITLES</span><h3>TWO CROWNS.</h3><p>Drivers accumulate individual points. Team points combine both drivers across all eight rounds.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="page-container"><div class="editorial-photo">{img(3,'../')}</div><div class="split-editorial"><h2 class="display-xl">THE PEOPLE<br>BEHIND <span class="text-lime">PACE.</span></h2><div><p class="lead">The race begins long before the lights go out.</p><p>Engineering, teamwork and split-second judgement turn electric power into position on the circuit.</p>{a('../teams/','MEET THE TEAMS ↗','text-link')}</div></div></div></section>'''
